  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "積體電路設計暨佈局實務",
    "sub_ename": "DESIGN AND LAYOUT IMPLEMENTATION OF INTEGRATED CIRCUIT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以積體電路設計暨佈局實務為主體，讓學生從事積體電路實體佈局之練習，增進學生對積體電路Full-Custom Design Flow設計方式之認識，建立其掌握各種積體電路設計與佈局之實務技術。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the practice of integrated circuit design and layout. It allows students to practice the physical layout of integrated circuits, enhances students’ understanding of the full-custom design flow design methods of integrated circuits. This course can help the students to grasp the practical technology of IC design and establishes the students'  mastery of various integrated circuit designs and layouts.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
